Z||000000||Dave Gunsul||08-20-2001||02:45 PM||||Here's my 86 GT.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-203F_2.jpg"> <P>Paint: 1970 GTO Orbit orange.<BR>Mods:<BR>2.8 bored and stroked to 3.2.<BR>Custom Ross forged pistons at 10:1 comp.<BR>Bored out t-body and upper plenum.<BR>ported lower intake.<BR>stainless swirl polished valves.<BR>Comp. Cams cam and 1.52 roller tipped rockers.<BR>Sprint headers with coating.<BR>Holley scoop and K@N filter.<BR>Ocelot performance exhaust.<BR>Strainght pipe in place of cat.<BR>Accel super coil and 8.8 wires.<BR>MSD 6A igniton box.<BR>Hypertech adj. fuel pressure regulator.<BR>ADS strip chip.<BR>ADS injectors.<BR>KYB gas shocks/struts.<BR>Fiero store cross drilled rotors.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-201F_1.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
Z||000001||RossT||08-20-2001||02:48 PM||||Way to go Dave!!!! looking good!!||||reg||1
Z||000002||Dave Gunsul||08-20-2001||02:51 PM||||Here's the back.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-199F.jpg"> <P>Here's the inside.<BR>Sorry about the size of the pics. but this is the first time i've posted pics.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/MVC-198E.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
