Z||000005||Dave Gunsul||08-20-2001||04:22 PM||||Thanks guys. The car runs very well although<BR>i'm still doing some tuning. The engines<BR>only got two hundred and some odd miles on it since the rebuild.<P>Next years possible mods:<BR>4:10 tranny swap. (Thanks to Moo Cow for answering my questions on this)<BR>chucking the injection in favor of a carb set-up. Then I can really go radical with some other mods.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> (thanks to Formula for answering my questions on this.)<P>(Special thanks to Paul Vargyas for taking the pics.)<P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver<p>[This message has been edited by Dave Gunsul (edited 08-20-2001).]||||reg||10
