Z||000012||Dave Gunsul||08-20-2001||09:46 PM||||Thank you all for the compliments, it's especially nice to hear this from my Fiero brethren. It's been a very long road so far and there's still a LOT of work that has to be done yet to the car but at least i'm starting to get somewhere with it.<P>Now if I can just keep everyone from trying<BR>to touch or lean on it i'd be even happier.<BR>How many "do not touch" signs do you have to put up anyway?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Dave Gunsul<BR>N.I.F.E. member<BR>86 GT modified<BR>85 SE daily driver||||reg||1
