Z||000031||Oreif||08-22-2001||01:48 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Haze_Performance:<BR><B>Where did you get the exhaust tips? Are they stainless or plated? I want to change the tips on my '85. I like the straight look better than the megaphone.<P>Thanx. <BR>Haze<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Those are the Ocelot tips. I have them too!<P>Hey Dave, I just looked up the weather for the GTO show, Possible rain in the early morning, Are you still going?<P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">    <BR><B><I>Got Emblems?</I></B>||||reg||1
Z||000032||Haze_Performance||08-22-2001||01:55 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Oreif:<BR><B> Those are the Ocelot tips. I have them too!<P>Hey Dave, I just looked up the weather for the GTO show, Possible rain in the early morning, Are you still going?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Hey Oreif,<BR>How do you think it will sound on a 4 cyl.? I might change my entire system.<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.ws6fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/indyclick.gif">          <BR></A>||||reg||14
